es ever feel the same.\n\nCustomize your Goob, experiment with different playstyles, and discover new ways to outmaneuver your opponents. With a focus on social interaction, replayability, and high-energy gameplay, Goobvr creates unforgettable VR moments you\u2019ll want to experience again and again.\n\nGet ready to run, laugh, and tag\u2014because in Goobvr, you\u2019re always one move away from victory.", "short_description": "Goobvr is a locomotion Multiplayer  Vr game that has horror  Pvp  parkour Shop only up Horror   "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1S9iM5CNkXyhz6HRCpcLiH_YM9Q7uzG73ioOaOfZCOcA/edit?tab=t.0#heading=h.m5g0yqeaxo3v", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Velz", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1S9iM5CNkXyhz6HRCpcLiH_YM9Q7uzG73ioOaOfZCOcA/edit?tab=t.0#heading=h.m5g0yqeaxo3v", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "35016038254709319"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1892781958061844"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1892781958061844"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1776974160, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1892781958061844"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary